       q:"Digital Nomads\n\n\"There are many upsides to the location independence (19) ____.\" \n\nA that they have with their peers\nB they will have such a possibility\nC to work in different places\nD why they would choose such a lifestyle\nE remote work has become a reality\nF work when and where they want to\nG who travel to different locations on a regular basis",
