        q:"You will hear five phone messages.\nMatch each message (1–5) and its meaning (A–F).\nThere is one letter that you do not need.\n\nA — You should cooperate with them.\nB — You've done everything possible.\nC — I'll do whatever you want.\nD — You can coordinate the activity.\nE — I can help out.\nF — Give yourself another chance.",
