       q:"What does Ben say about the game he's playing?\n\n\"I've been playing this action video game for hours. It's supposed to develop your reflexes. After all that work, I expected to be feeling good about myself but right now I don't think I can get up from my desk. And I've had more fun cleaning up my room.\"\n\nA It's exhausting.\nB It's satisfying.\nC It's entertaining.",
       opts:["It's exhausting.","It's satisfying.","It's entertaining."],
       sol:{cl:"A"},
       exp:"'I don't think I can get up from my desk' i 'I've had more fun cleaning my room' → igra je iscrpljujuća (A = exhausting)."
