       q:"Monarch butterflies\n\n\"Only monarchs born in late summer or early fall make the migration, (19) ___.\" \n\nA enough for them to fly\nB and they make only one round trip\nC those that do so during the summer\nD which will kill them if they wait too long\nE they must prepare for their long journey\nF those were threatened by natural disasters\nG that brings millions to California and Mexico each winter",
       opts:["A — enough for them to fly","B — and they make only one round trip","C — those that do so during the summer","D — which will kill them if they wait too long","E — they must prepare for their long journey","F — those were threatened by natural disasters","G — that brings millions to California and Mexico each winter"],
