       q:"The Image of Me\n\n\"Keep your tongue behind your teeth and avoid saying 'cheese' while you're looking at the camera (20) ___.\" \n\nA to help you decide when you look best\nB because it amuses them\nC when someone grabs the camera to take your picture\nD because it freezes your smile\nE when it looks the most natural\nF which will immediately relax your muscles\ng how to improve your looks in a photo",
