       opts:["A — Be aware of all the work that came before.","B — It will help you be miserable in comfort.","C — A fine stretch to fit wonderful endeavours.","D — Wasting time seeking validation.","E — Such thoughts serve to knock down obstacles.","F — Dishonesty, disrespect, unhappiness and evil exist and you will have to deal with them.","G — You can't influence unmet expectations.","H — Nor does it insulate you from pain."],
